{
  "movie_id": 509400701,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 3.3,
      "end_time": 5.6,
      "text": "First of all, eat this snack"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 6.5,
      "end_time": 8.6,
      "text": "And then drink this Barley Soda~"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 8.8,
      "end_time": 10.6,
      "text": "Ohhh! What a....!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 11.3,
      "end_time": 13.3,
      "text": "Boy, are you having fun?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 13.6,
      "end_time": 14.6,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 15.0,
      "end_time": 17.1,
      "text": "I am too."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 18.3,
      "end_time": 19.1,
      "text": "Phew"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 21.0,
      "end_time": 23.2,
      "text": "What a pleasant breeze"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 24.2,
      "end_time": 25.8,
      "text": "So this is camping..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 26.3,
      "end_time": 29.1,
      "text": "This is a vacation, huh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 32.1,
      "end_time": 36.2,
      "text": "I received valuable advice from Yukari-san for the BB Brigade!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 36.5,
      "end_time": 40.0,
      "text": "For me, it's a piece of cake!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 40.2,
      "end_time": 42.2,
      "text": "Drink Barley Soda with everyone──"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 43.6,
      "end_time": 45.0,
      "text": "Pwah~"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 45.4,
      "end_time": 48.6,
      "text": "──Grant me the power of inspiration~!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 49.5,
      "end_time": 52.0,
      "text": "Though you're the only one drinking..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 52.8,
      "end_time": 55.2,
      "text": "But everyone seems to be having fun, and that's what matters."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 55.5,
      "end_time": 56.2,
      "text": "Leave it to me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 56.6,
      "end_time": 61.0,
      "text": "It's like a dream for me, the loner, to be able to camp with everyone!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 64.6,
      "end_time": 69.0,
      "text": "Looking back, ever since I formed the BB Brigade with you,"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 69.2,
      "end_time": 71.0,
      "text": "I've had various encounters."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 73.0,
      "end_time": 75.0,
      "text": "The members of the Friendship Club and──"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 75.8,
      "end_time": 78.5,
      "text": "──Leader-san and Tamaki-san"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 79.5,
      "end_time": 81.2,
      "text": "And this time,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 81.6,
      "end_time": 83.6,
      "text": "Yukari-san and Jun-san..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 85.1,
      "end_time": 88.0,
      "text": "Every encounter was given to me by you."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 88.5,
      "end_time": 90.0,
      "text": "That's why..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 90.6,
      "end_time": 94.4,
      "text": "I want to say \"Sayonara\" to loner-me with you."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 94.8,
      "end_time": 96.1,
      "text": "Please continue to support me."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 96.6,
      "end_time": 97.5,
      "text": "Sniff..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 98.2,
      "end_time": 100.5,
      "text": "That's a heartwarming story...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 102.0,
      "end_time": 103.1,
      "text": "This camp and..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 103.3,
      "end_time": 105.3,
      "text": "And the best camping buddies..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 106.2,
      "end_time": 108.4,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 109.0,
      "end_time": 110.4,
      "text": "Cheers!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 110.6,
      "end_time": 111.6,
      "text": "To our camping buddies!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 112.3,
      "end_time": 114.0,
      "text": "Let's~…………"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 115.0,
      "end_time": 116.8,
      "text": "Cheers!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 117.6,
      "end_time": 119.6,
      "text": "Now, the night is just beginning!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 120.0,
      "end_time": 123.5,
      "text": "We'll keep drinking~!!"
    }
  ],
